<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
We want our customers to have a smooth and seamless journey every time they fly with us, so I'm sorry to hear about the unexpected expense you incurred due to the schedule change/flight delay of QFXXX, dd/mm/yyyy.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
We would be happy to review a claim for the fare difference between your Qantas ticket and the new ticket you purchased.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Please accept my apology, on behalf of Qantas, for the inconvenience caused by the change to your QF flight schedule.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
If you have travel insurance and require an insurance letter, please let me know as I would be happy to provide this for you.<br />
<br />
<strong>Next steps&nbsp;</strong><br />
Please respond to this email attaching your receipts. We’ll review the submitted receipts and notify you of the outcome.<br />
<br />
Once again, on behalf of the team at Qantas, we apologise for the inconvenience experienced and look forward to welcoming you on board again soon.</p>
